FAIL testdata/bad/timeout-too-long.yaml:2:10  PQ1021: 48h is over the ceiling of 24h

   1 | name: report
>  2 | timeout: 48h
                ^
   3 | steps:

   A timeout is mandatory and it has a ceiling (08 section 3.2). A job that runs
   longer than a day is a service, and paceq supervises jobs.

   Split it into steps with their own timeouts, or run it as a service and let
   paceq check on it instead.

   paceq error PQ1021  for the full explanation
